    <TEXT>
        <Tag>TXT_KEY_SPELL_ELEMENTAL_SWARM_HELP</Tag>
        <English>[ICON_BULLET]Spawns an elder elemental on every elemental node you own[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Grants 1 xp per permanent elemental you own (and 1 extra xp if it is huge) for every unit with elemental ancestry (no matter the type)</English>
