        <Spanish>[ICON_BULLET]Spawns an elder elemental on every elemental node you own[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Grants 1 xp per permanent elemental you own (and 1 extra xp if it is huge) for every unit with elemental ancestry (no matter the type)</Spanish>
    </TEXT>
